title: Pull request process
---
flowchart LR
	pr["Open PR<br/>title + description"] --> checks{"Required checks<br/>pass?"}
	checks -->|Yes| review{"Maintainer<br/>approves?"}
	checks -->|No| update["Fix issues<br/>and update PR"]
	review -->|Changes requested| update
	review -->|Approved| merge["Merge PR"]
	update --> checks
